Skills that Claude Code and Codex get from plugins

Pi and OpenCode have no plugin for these, so they load this folder through
their skills settings; fx has no such setting and gets a copy in ~/.fx/skills.
Claude Code and Codex do not scan it, so their plugin copies are not duplicated.
Each link lists the upstream commits for that skill. Anything newer than the
synced commit is an upstream change not yet merged here.

Skill                   Synced   Upstream history
1password-environments  46c4ac8  https://github.com/1Password/1password-codex-plugin/commits/main/plugins/1password/skills/1password-environments

1password-environments is copied unchanged from 1Password's Codex plugin
(https://github.com/1Password/1password-codex-plugin), without its Codex-only
agents/ and assets/ folders.

